('B29','{"id":"B29","stem":"A student concludes that religion and science must always be enemies. Which course example challenges that conclusion?","options":["The meaning of the word techne","The existence of scientific observations","The recording of medicine on clay tablets","The Roman Catholic position summarized as allowing harmony"],"correct":3,"explanation":"The course includes a Catholic position in which faith and scientific study can be compatible.","set":"B","tag":"Revision challenge","follow":"Explain why the correct option fits, and why one other option does not."}'::jsonb,null),
